 boundaries</h2><p>仅显示实际记录的版本；未生成成长趋势。象征解释、财务账本及市场事实未自动加入。<br>Only recorded versions are represented; no growth trend is invented. Symbolic interpretations, financial ledgers and market facts are not automatically imported.</p><p>撤销可阻止新读取，无法远程收回已下载副本。<br>Revocation prevents new access, but cannot recall downloaded copies.</p></section></main></html>`;
